  "notes": "BUSINESS VOCABULARY:\n{顧客|こきゃく} is a formal business term. In everyday conversation, {客|きゃく} or お{客|きゃく}さん is more common.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {客|きゃく} - customer (casual)\n- お{客|きゃく}さん - customer (polite)\n- {得意先|とくいさき} - regular customer, client (business)\n- クライアント - client (loanword)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {顧客|こきゃく}{満足度|まんぞくど} - customer satisfaction\n- {顧客|こきゃく}{管理|かんり} - customer management\n- {顧客|こきゃく}データ - customer data\n- {新規|しんき}{顧客|こきゃく} - new customer\n- {既存|きそん}{顧客|こきゃく} - existing customer\n- {顧客|こきゃく}{対応|たいおう} - customer service/handling",
